# ----------------------------------------
# REVIEW CLARIFICATIONS
# ----------------------------------------

# For sensitive or high-impact changes, review cycle is extended:
# - Critical security updates: 48 hours minimum review
# - Content changes affecting safety protocols: 24 hours minimum review
# - Accessibility changes: 24 hours minimum review + accessibility testing

# "Virtual Owners" - Team representatives for specific content areas:
# These users appear when a PR touches their domain, but don't own all changes:

# Accessibility virtual owners (for accessibility PRs):
modules/ || *.md                @accessibility-champion

# Safety virtual owners (for safety protocol changes):
modules/safety-protocols/   @safety-lead

# Community outreach (for PR ecosystem changes):
.github/ || docs/ || CONTRIBUTING.md    @community-manager

# Edge case: When no owner matches, defaults to project-lead team
# This ensures all changes get reviewed even if pattern matching fails